**/.env*
!**/.env.example
.claude
**/.claude
.git
**/.git
**/cdk.out
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
.kiro
docs/images
samples/hydrolix
samples/hub/cdk
samples/*/tests
